          "id": "23867669b0120cb170a7669a8275f4431de9ca6a",
          "message": "feat(sparq-kb): stamp prov:generatedAtTime on literature findings and activities (sq-tzars.2) [HAIKU-4.5] (#1530)\n\nImplement timestamp injection on all machine-tier findings and their extraction\nactivities via prov:generatedAtTime (ISO 8601 xsd:dateTime). Add SHACL RULE 4 to\nliterature.shapes.ttl requiring the timestamp on machine-extracted findings, with\nfail-closed quarantine for timestamp-less findings. Timestamps are injectable for\ndeterministic test fixtures via run_with_time(); default to current UTC in live use.\n\nAcceptance: cargo test -p sparq-kb --features literature,validate passes with explicit\npositive case (timestamped finding passes SHACL) and negative case (finding without\ntimestamp is rejected by RULE 4). Both feature states (feature OFF and feature ON) green.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-05T02:18:11Z",
